# Lutri, the Spellchaser copies Bot1's Fiery Confluence, cast with "deals 2 damage to each opponent" once and "Destroy target
# artifact" twice, at Bot2's Mox Pearl and Mox Jet. The copy has the same three modes (CR 707.10, 707.10c) and Bot1 may choose
# new targets for it: each instance of the repeated mode is its own target, asked on its own in printed order (CR 700.2d,
# 115.7d) - Mox Emerald for the first and Sol Ring for the second - and the mode that targets nothing asks nothing. The copy
# resolves first: 2 damage to Bot2, Mox Emerald and Sol Ring destroyed; then the original: 2 more, Mox Pearl and Mox Jet
# destroyed. Left on its old targets, the copy would destroy nothing and Mox Emerald and Sol Ring would survive.

